---
description: House rules for the biolabsresearch.co storefront
alwaysApply: true
---

Static storefront, research use only. No build step: files under `html/` are served as they are.
Prices, products, discounts and orders live behind the `/api/` Node service, not in this repo.
The same files are also served on `blrcommerce.io`.

# Do not rewrite the shared scripts

`html/cart-vial.js`, `html/mg-picker.js`, `html/prices-sync.js`, `html/email-capture.js`,
`html/product-marquee.js` are maintained by infra and carry fixes the pages rely on. Change the page
instead. If one of them truly must change, say so in the commit message. The cookie banner
(`consent.js`) is injected by nginx and is not in this repo — do not add a second banner.

# Prices

Read them from `/api/products`. Never write a price list into a page or a script.
The catalog has `price`, `original_price`, `strengths`, `strength_prices`, `strength_originals`.
For most products `strengths[0]` is the smaller dose and `price` is the price of the largest one, so:

- a card that prints a strength prints that strength's price from `strength_prices`;
- a strikethrough comes from `strength_originals` for the selected strength;
- no `strength_originals` means no strikethrough, not the base price.

Never pair a 5 mg label with the 10 mg price.

# Cart

Every add button passes `data-mg`, and every cart line holds `mg` plus that dose's price as a number.
A line without a strength cannot be shipped or price-checked.

In each `products/*.html`, `updateQty` must start with `var cart = getCart();` and must call
`saveCart(cart)` with the argument. `saveCart()` with no argument writes an empty cart and wipes the
visitor's basket. After editing a product page, exercise plus, minus and remove in the drawer.

# API paths

Relative only: `/api/products`, never `https://biolabsresearch.co/api/...`. The site runs on two domains.

# Every page

- fits the screen: `documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth` at 375 and 390 px;
- ends with the site footer from `index.html`, which carries the research-use-only line;
- appears in `html/sitemap.xml` if it is public. Keep out `admin.html`, `404.html`, `checkout.html`,
  the Google verification file and the `product` template.

# Language

No accounts exist: never write "sign in", "my account" or "track your order". No invented purity
percentages, no fabricated reviews, no dosing or human-use advice. Certificates are "on request".

# Checkout / payments

Visible tip is **v3.00b** (`css-cache-align-407` on 3.00a / 3.00 / g1 catalog-filter-flicker-fix / g hub-spoke-dynamic-coa / f1 catalog-mobile-2col / f SEO L1 / e3 mobile-catalog / e2 / G3-R e1 / abandoned-checkout v2.99e / Quote v2.99d). CRM `paymentsEnabled:false`.
Primary CTA is **Request a Quote**. Browser POSTs (no card fields) to
`https://crm.biolabsresearch.co/api/checkout/quote` with camelCase `idempotencyKey` (`BL-QUOTE-<stable-id>`)
and the same `session_id` as abandon capture. Abandoned checkout POSTs
`https://crm.biolabsresearch.co/api/checkout/abandon` (204 silent; 400 if card fields). Capture on
contact→shipping, email blur ~800ms, pagehide/visibility sendBeacon. Throttle 20–30s. Never break quote/charge.
Success copy lock: **We'll send your quote within one business day.**
GA: keep `checkout_start`; on quote ok fire `generate_lead`; do **not** fire `checkout_complete` while payments off.
Charge path (`/api/checkout/charge`, `checkout-charge.js`) is retained unused — do not delete it.

Owner decision (CRM charge SoT, when payments return): browser POSTs card fields to the CRM sidecar
`https://crm.biolabsresearch.co/api/checkout/charge` with camelCase `idempotencyKey`.
Card path remains the v2.99b CRM UMG authorize hook (retained unused while payments are off). Infra reviews before customers see live charges.

**robots.txt / IndexNow:** Keep the v2.99d AI-crawler `Allow: /` list. Same IndexNow key as d. After **v3.00** is live, run `scripts/indexnow-ping.sh`. Do not block abandon capture on the ping.

- No full card number, expiry date or CVV may reach storefront `/api/*`, the Node service, a new
  endpoint, or anything persisted in this repo. Do not `console.log` charge bodies.
- Do not call `pay.umg.inc` from this repo. Do not install or copy the UMG WooCommerce plugin
  (it prints PAN/CVV to the console). This site is not WordPress.
- No payment keys in pages, scripts, commit messages or logs. Secret keys live on the server, with infra.
- An order keeps only the last four digits and the provider's transaction ID. CVV is never stored or logged.
- Charge success UI and GA `checkout_complete` only after charge `ok===true`. No cascade copy to the customer.
- No Apple Pay or Google Pay logos unless the provider takes them.
- Before payment code goes live, add a row to `QA_TASKS.md` with owner `infra`. Exceptions need a
  written decision by the business owner, recorded in `AGENTS.md`.

# Working here

Small commits with a readable prefix. The server working copy is live and shared: check `git status`
for the file first and leave someone else's uncommitted changes alone. Never `git reset --hard`,
`git clean` or `git stash`. Open tasks with owners are in `QA_TASKS.md`.
